{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj5PBeXuYStPAjQd72ZR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The lock clicks. The ancient mechanism turns.*\n\n*I swing open slowly, hinges groaning with the weight of ages.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor stretching into darkness, the faint smell of stone and forgotten time, a draft carrying whispers too old to understand.*\n\n*I am open.*\n\n*Will you pass through?*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":76,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}